  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung listens and asks his sons.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Tell your old father what I have heard you are busy about.\"",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"Well, and my second son is busy with his grain market and he is getting it up in the town with a great store of grain and he will have great wealth and there he will be,\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung asks sons about their sons.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Tell me of your son!\"",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son is indifferent to his father's question.",
  "[silence] the second son says nothing.",
  "Wang Lung: \"Now I am old and forgetful and I do not know what I say,\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung stops and sits down on the ground.",
  "[action] The eldest son stands at the front of the family.",
